        "custom_liquid": "<!-- ============================================================\n     ibBan B2B — PART 2 (closing CTA)\n     Paste this AFTER your Judge.me reviews widget (which goes below PART 1).\n     Self-contained: own styles + fonts. Matches Part 1 (B&W, Cormorant+Jost).\n     ============================================================ -->\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant:wght@400;500;600&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<style>\n\n\n\n\n\n.ibo2,.ibo2 *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\n.ibo2{\n  --ink:#141414; --muted:#6B6B6B; --line:rgba(0,0,0,.14); --black:#111111;\n  --serif:'Cormorant',Georgia,serif; --sans:'Jost',-apple-system,sans-serif;\n  font-family:var(--sans); color:var(--ink); background:#fff;\n  font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n}\n.ibo2 a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n.ibo2 .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}\n.ibo2 .eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}\n.ibo2 .closing{padding:56px 0;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.ibo2 .closing h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(28px,7vw,42px);line-height:1.08;margin-top:12px}\n.ibo2 .closing p{color:var(--muted);font-weight:300;margin-top:12px;max-width:46ch;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}\n.ibo2 .row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center;margin-top:24px}\n.ibo2 .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;cursor:pointer;\n  font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px;letter-spacing:.03em;border:1px solid var(--black);border-radius:10px!important;\n  background:var(--black);color:#fff;padding:16px 28px;min-height:52px;transition:opacity .2s}\n.ibo2 .btn:hover{opacity:.88}\n.ibo2 .btn svg{width:16px;height:16px;stroke:#fff;fill:none;stroke-width:2}\n.ibo2 .wa{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:52px;\n  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px!important;font-weight:500;font-size:13.5px;padding:0 26px}\n.ibo2 .wa:hover{border-color:var(--black)}\n.ibo2 .wa svg{width:17px;height:17px;fill:#121212}\n@media(max-width:520px){\n  .ibo2 .wrap{padding:0 18px}\n  .ibo2 .closing{padding:32px 0}\n  .ibo2 .closing h2{font-size:clamp(26px,7.5vw,34px)}\n  .ibo2 .closing p{margin-top:10px}\n  .ibo2 .btn,.ibo2 .wa{width:100%}\n}\n@media(min-width:860px){.ibo2 .wrap{padding:0 36px}}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ibo2\">\n  <section class=\"closing\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Open your trade account</span>\n    <h2>Ready to stock ibBan?</h2>\n    <p>Apply in 60 seconds and get your catalogue, price list and trade login — reply within one business day.</p>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <!-- #apply scrolls up to the form in PART 1 (same page) -->\n      <a href=\"#apply\" class=\"btn\">Get wholesale account access\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n      <a class=\"wa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n         href=\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=34689948641&text=Hi%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20B2B%20%2F%20Wholesale%20pricing.\">\n         <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163a11.867 11.867 0 01-1.587-5.946C.16 5.335 5.495 0 12.05 0a11.817 11.817 0 018.413 3.488 11.824 11.824 0 013.48 8.414c-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892a11.9 11.9 0 01-5.688-1.448L.057 24z\"/></svg>\n         Chat on WhatsApp</a>\n    </div>\n  </div></section>\n</div>",
